 '| Absentee processing/tabulation | Board convenes no later than9am election day. Commissioner may begin count the day before, and must if the preceding general count missed10pm. Results/progress cannot be released before pollclose, and tabulation release requires completion of the ballots it must count that day. Staffing10pm objective is not a measured completion guarantee. | '+citation('law-53.23','§53.23')+' |',
