 'The October absentee publications are real administrative evidence, not results:99county controls sum176,012 requested,176,014 issued,33,418 received, matching the separate state control. Issued exceeds requested by2; no cause is inferred. County pages carry both10/15 and10/16 dates at8AMUTC; the state page says10/16 at7AMUTC. Preserve each physical page’s date/clock, literal UD and other receipt-method labels, party registration categories and blank Received cells. Requested−received is not Senate votes remaining, and these publications do not show candidate choice, valid-contest participation or final eligible late ballots. '+citation('sos-2026-absentee-county','County absentee report')+', '+citation('sos-2026-absentee-state','State absentee report')+'.','',
 '**Priority and native conservation.** Research priority uses2024President seven named ticket columns plus genericWrite-in marks:1,663,506 total (named1,656,849;generic6,657), excluding8,586 under/1,919 over. Top15=991,869; preceding40=1,322,507; exact41=1,332,107, crossing Henry19087=9,600. All58 other counties remain in inventory/state arithmetic. Ordered IA:FIPS key SHA256 `e015514b8718b35e9599389cddde2451e5cd598115ef4d6468016a7858271f95`. Frozen final priority bytes9,106,895 SHA256 `579b22b8d4f35f12d085ef8402a1bcab14e135a1577daf3ddc4f7d3f66460822`. See [final contract](data/turnout/priority-set.json), [coordinator county review](data/coordinator-baseline-reconciliation.json) and [native review](data/coordinator-native-contract-checks.json).','',
 'Independent offline parsing conserves13,558 exact constituent objects/order/scopes and all99county rosters. It checks all26,448 selected original2024county candidate/method cells and2,376county controls against peer extracts and statewide ticket sums. Counts remain2024candidate1,653/rootturnout1,651/status1,653;2022candidate1,653;2020candidate1,661;4990statistical labels and297administrative county contexts. Every original source/sheet/row/column or XML/JSON path remains available. Full selected2022/2020 cell/registration/statistical extracts and original manifests are pinned read-only dependencies; no new completeness is inferred from worker done flags. [Independent native checks](data/results-sources/native-validation.json), [all constituent objects](data/results-sources/native-constituent-inventory.jsonl.gz), [native XML position inventory](data/results-sources/native-selected-position-inventory.jsonl.gz), [dependencies](data/results-sources/dependencies.json).','',
